# Creating Experiment Pages

When creating a new experiment page, follow these steps in order:

## 1. Reference the Template

Always start by reading `experiments/template.html` to understand the current page structure, styling, and component usage.

Key elements from the template:
- Inter font preloading (`<link rel="preload">` + stylesheet in each page)
- Shared baseline styles: `/experiments/experiments.css`
- Shared init script: `/experiments/experiments.js` (menu dimming + fonts-loaded)
- `<site-nav>` component for navigation
- Experiment structure: `.experiment-header`, `.experiment-content`, `.experiment-footer`
- Optional `.experiment-demo` iframe for interactive prototypes

## 2. Create the Experiment Page

Create a new folder under `/experiments/` with a URL-friendly name (lowercase, hyphens instead of spaces):

```
/experiments/[slug]/index.html
```

Include:
- Appropriate `<title>` tag: "Experiment Title | Rob Boyett"
- `<link rel="stylesheet" href="/experiments/experiments.css">` for shared baseline styles
- `<script src="/experiments/experiments.js"></script>` before the analytics script
- All necessary images/assets in the same folder
- Cabin analytics script before the closing `</body>` tag:
  ```html
  <!-- Analytics -->
  <script async defer src="https://scripts.withcabin.com/hello.js"></script>
  ```

For interactive demos, either embed via iframe in `.experiment-demo` or link to an existing prototype path. Legacy prototypes in `/experiments/` can stay where they are — showcase pages link to them.

## 3. Update experiments.xml (Grid Catalog)

After the page is complete, add an entry to `/experiments.xml` for the experiments grid index.

Add a new `<entry>` element near the **top** of the file (newest entries first):

```xml
<entry>
    <title>Experiment Title</title>
    <url>/experiments/slug/</url>
    <description>A brief description shown on the grid card.</description>
    <thumbnail>/experiments/slug/thumb.png</thumbnail>
</entry>
```

The `<thumbnail>` element is optional. Without it, the grid shows a typographic placeholder.

## Checklist

Before considering an experiment page complete:

- [ ] Page created at `/experiments/[slug]/index.html`
- [ ] Title and description are correct
- [ ] `<site-nav>` component included
- [ ] `/experiments/experiments.css` and `/experiments/experiments.js` linked
- [ ] Cabin analytics script added before `</body>`
- [ ] Entry added to `experiments.xml`
- [ ] All images/assets are in the page folder (or linked demo path works)
- [ ] Optional thumbnail added for grid card

## Not Required

- No `feed.xml` update (experiments are not in the RSS feed)
- No `journal.xml` update
